        <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">	1140 Alger St SW Wyoming, Michigan 49509</Text>
      </Paragraph>
      <Paragraph Alignment="Full" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="1.00" OutlineLevel="1" RightIndent="7.50" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No">
        <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">	616 818 5413</Text>
      </Paragraph>
      <Paragraph Alignment="Full" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="1.00" OutlineLevel="1" RightIndent="7.50" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No">
        <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">	davidquangpham@outlook</Text>
        <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">.</Text>
        <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">com</Text>
      </Paragraph>
      <Paragraph Alignment="Center" FirstIndent="-0.75" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="1.00" OutlineLevel="1" RightIndent="7.50" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="Yes">
        <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps">synopsis</Text>
      </Paragraph>
      <Paragraph Alignment="Center" FirstIndent="-0.50" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.50" OutlineLevel="1" RightIndent="7.50" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
      <Paragraph Alignment="Center" FirstIndent="-0.75" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="1.25" OutlineLevel="1" RightIndent="7.50" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
      <Paragraph Alignment="Full" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.50" OutlineLevel="1" RightIndent="7.50" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No">
        <Tabstops>
          <Tabstop Position="1.25" Type="Left"/>
        </Tabstops>
      </Paragraph>
      <Paragraph Alignment="Full" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="1.00" OutlineLevel="1" RightIndent="7.50" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No">
        <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">TURNOVER is an herbal fable about a queer family turning a Vietnamese family’s life around. It plots a tanning salon by a nightclub, respectively Tan </Text>
        <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">Salontro</Text>
        <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style=""> and </Text>
        <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">FigLeaf</Text>
        <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style=""> Nightclub.</Text>
      </Paragraph>
      <Paragraph Alignment="Full" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="1.00" OutlineLevel="1" RightIndent="7.50" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
      <Paragraph Alignment="Full" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="1.00" OutlineLevel="1" RightIndent="7.50" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No">
        <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">In Dirty City, a Cilantro arrives. Rau </Text>
        <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">Răm</Text>
        <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style=""> is an Asian immigrant and expectant mother hoping to start a tanning salon business. When no one can spare a plot of land, Malus Crabapple welcomes her with a neighboring open plot. Rau is a bit hesitant due to Malus’s gay nightclub known as </Text>
        <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">FigLeaf</Text>
        <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">. But </Text>
        <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">FigLeaf</Text>
        <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style=""> patrons have a liking for Rau’s body oil that spices up their skins. Rau happily takes their money but cannot support their ”lifestyles.” But the major turnover would be Rau’s son: Reynold (”Move the Plot Forward”).</Text>
      </Paragraph>
      <Paragraph Alignment="Full" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="1.00" OutlineLevel="1" RightIndent="7.50" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
      <Paragraph Alignment="Full" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="1.00" OutlineLevel="1" RightIndent="7.50" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No">
        <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">This teen operates the day-to-day Tan </Text>
        <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">Salontro</Text>
        <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style=""> business and spends the nights with his mom (”A Natural”). Later, Malus introduces Reynold to their teenage nibling, Pyrus. Reynold helps Pyrus with issues that they have with the other flowers (“Grow a Pair”). Pyrus pays Reynold with a new beverage, called Miracle, and invites him to hang out (”Test the Water”).</Text>
      </Paragraph>
      <Paragraph Alignment="Full" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="1.00" OutlineLevel="1" RightIndent="7.50" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
      <Paragraph Alignment="Full" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="1.00" OutlineLevel="1" RightIndent="7.50" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No">
        <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">Reynold asks his mom to see a movie with Pyrus. She reluctantly lets him go. At Cantaloupe Outlets, Reynold and Pyrus pose in a photo booth (”Photosynthesis”). Pyrus takes him clothes shopping. He discovers a liking for different floral styles, especially crop tops (”Crop Top”). Nearby, Rau picks a fight with Malus due to Parsley’s sudden sense of freedom. They soon bump into Reynold and Pyrus. Rau's world turns upside down when she sees Parsley’s crop top. Malus explains Rau’s prejudice to Pyrus (”Soiled”).</Text>
      </Paragraph>
      <Paragraph Alignment="Full" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="1.00" OutlineLevel="1" RightIndent="7.50" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
      <Paragraph Alignment="Full" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="1.00" OutlineLevel="1" RightIndent="7.50" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No">
        <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">Reynold is grounded (“Fertile”). Soon, Pyrus helps Reynold sneak out. With their guest </Text>
        <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">DJ</Text>
        <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style=""> Cauliflower, they have the time of their lives (”Dirt on You”). However, herbs are not accustomed to the nightlife and this one is especially underaged. Reynold blackouts and ends up in the hospital, getting his stoma pumped.</Text>
      </Paragraph>
      <Paragraph Alignment="Full" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="1.00" OutlineLevel="1" RightIndent="7.50" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
      <Paragraph Alignment="Full" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="1.00" OutlineLevel="1" RightIndent="7.50" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No">
        <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">Rau sees the light of their ways with Malus (”Green Card”). </Text>
        <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">FigLeaf</Text>
        <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style=""> shuts down due to the violation of underage drinking laws. Pyrus visits Reynold, letting him know that they prepare to move (”Sterilize”). Rau offers Pyrus a summer job if they ever are around again. After all, it is a family business (”Turnover”).</Text>
      </Paragraph>
      <Paragraph Alignment="Full" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="1.00" OutlineLevel="1" RightIndent="7.50" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
      <Paragraph Alignment="Full" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="1.00" OutlineLevel="1" RightIndent="7.50" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No">
        <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">What are the turnovers of this sunny salon and this night saloon? How a growing child flips over to and accepts the darkness is the petal of this floral coming-of-age story.</Text>
      </Paragraph>
      <Paragraph Alignment="Center" FirstIndent="-0.75" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="1.25" OutlineLevel="1" RightIndent="7.50" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="Yes">
        <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps">Cast of Characters</Text>
      </Paragraph>
      <Paragraph Alignment="Center" FirstIndent="-0.50" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.50" OutlineLevel="1" RightIndent="7.50" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
      <Paragraph Alignment="Center" FirstIndent="-0.75" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="1.25" OutlineLevel="1" RightIndent="7.50" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
